Z||000006||V8Fiero||06-10-2001||08:55 PM||||Trying to look at this like someone who doesnt know anything about fieros and kitcars.<P>My first few questions would be:<P>1) Why does a 2001 Lambo have a Corvette LT1 engine in it?<P>2) What is a Archie kit?<P>3) Why would you take such an expensive auto (now remember, I think its authentic) <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"> and get it repainted?<P><BR>There has to be some legal issues here. Non disclosure of the vehicles true origins.<P>Nice car though. Too bad he will never sell it..<P>Scott<BR>||||reg||1
